WEBVTT

00:07:27.228 --> 00:07:30.323
in countries that are much more vigilant
in reducing antibiotics,

00:07:30.347 --> 00:07:32.566
like, for example,
Germany and the Netherlands,

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:34.934
were already 10 to 15 percent lower

00:07:34.958 --> 00:07:38.162
than in a country like the UK,
which was slower to pick this up.

00:07:39.742 --> 00:07:43.099
But, like with better hygiene,
better nutrition helps

00:07:43.123 --> 00:07:46.020
but will not totally prevent you
from becoming sick.

00:07:46.044 --> 00:07:47.424
So more is needed.

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:50.236
And that's why we turned
to the microbiome.

00:07:50.831 --> 00:07:53.006
Making the water with the feed more acidic

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:54.815
helps to create an environment

00:07:54.839 --> 00:07:57.204
that benefits the more beneficial bacteria

00:07:57.228 --> 00:07:59.028
and inhibits the pathogens.

00:07:59.514 --> 00:08:00.665
Like fermented food,